<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - US Bioscience added to list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - US Bioscience added to list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said analyst Jonas Alsenas initiated coverage of U.S. Bioscience Inc, and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Estimated loss of $0.20 per share for 1997, and profit $0.28 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Set mid-1998 price target of $29-$33.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 13-1/4.</p>
</text>
